  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency support to improve crop production in Tigray region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the project is to improve the food security and resilience of vulnerable households affected by conflict in Tigray. This will be achieved through the targeted distribution of agricultural inputs (Urea fertilizers and seeds), as well as the provision of targeted trainings addressing fertilizer application and handling, good agronomic practices (GAP), post-harvest handling and value addition.</narrative>
  </description>
